{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wukong UP</i> is a multiplayer online linked adventure game where you play as Wukong, who has been kidnapped by &quot;space robots&quot;. You'll go through 81 trials to break out of the cage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Countless fun level gameplay modes, all in one game to satisfy you!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not just a simple parkour game. During the gameplay, you can experience numerous modes including but not limited to jump games, sliding, and chase battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And all these gameplay modes can be enjoyed in <i>Wukong UP</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1761553435\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.mp4?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wukong vs. Space Robots!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What to do when facing the robots that kidnapped you? Of course, beat them up! Whether it's the Golden Cudgel or &quot;American Iai&quot;, you can use whatever you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's said that consecutive kills can increase your media rating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.poster.avif?t=1761553435\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.webm?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.mp4?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheongsam, swimsuit, twin tails? A variety of distinctive characters to choose from!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >72 transformations \u2013 whether it's the four of Tang Seng's disciples, or a wave of popular beautiful girls, Wukong can fulfill your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1761553435\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.mp4?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9996\u6b21\u8054\u673a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820450/cb183b02d9fbd5da3ab1b44d3bd2d76d7ef3f167.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e09\u6b21\u8054\u673a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820450/fad50da72d63dd6388ebdac5cdf126925575f971.jpg"},{"name":"\u4e94\u6b21\u8054\u673a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820450/6a7fc3baf97ee105fb5c45bfdf15d5eb2fd23a74.jpg"},{"name":"\u5341\u6b21\u8054\u673a","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2820450/259ffda759813089b17448e250e441dc11edc840.jpg"},{"name":"\u6536\u96c6\u9053\u51771","path":"https://cdn.ak