cing the robots that kidnapped you? Of course, beat them up! Whether it's the Golden Cudgel or &quot;American Iai&quot;, you can use whatever you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's said that consecutive kills can increase your media rating?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.poster.avif?t=1761553435\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.webm?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/52853fd6825412b6ab30b8c71935d014.mp4?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cheongsam, swimsuit, twin tails? A variety of distinctive characters to choose from!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >72 transformations \u2013 whether it's the four of Tang Seng's disciples, or a wave of popular beautiful girls, Wukong can fulfill your imagination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.poster.avif?t=1761553435\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.webm?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820450/extras/c038fa4844c7577f2bb71bad686fe2f2.mp4?t=1761553435\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["1ming\u76ca\u94ed"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descr